{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45417","headline":"皇太子频赐存问幷索唱和新诗因有陈谢 · 广宣","name":"皇太子频赐存问幷索唱和新诗因有陈谢","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"望苑招延後，禅扉访道余。\n祗言俟文雅，何意及庸虚。\n率性多非学，缘情偶自书。\n清风闻寺响，白日见心初。\n重道逢轩后，崇儒过魏储。\n青宫列芳梓，玄圃积琼琚。\n郑鼠宁容者，齐竽久舍诸。\n龙怀受恩感，含思几踌躇。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"广宣","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_45417.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45417","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}